8
Modify the above query so that the user is prompted for a LOC.
(Using Prompt)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> ACCEPT P_LOC PROMPT 'Enter Location : '

sql> SELECT ENAME, DEPTNO, JOB
     FROM EMP
     WHERE DEPTNO =
     (
         SELECT DEPTNO
         FROM DEPT
         WHERE LOC='&P_LOC'
     );

Sample Input:
-------------

Enter Location : DALLAS

Output:
-------

ENAME    DEPTNO   JOB
-------  ------   --------
SMITH       20    CLERK
JONES       20    MANAGER
SCOTT       20    ANALYST
ADAMS       20    CLERK
FORD        20    ANALYST
